  <title>GT Workload Cooling Needs</title> 
  <body> 
	 <ul id="GUID-88A5BC0B-344F-41E0-A687-FB2B9C3ED1D1"> 
		<li id="LI_EB4799343AA04073B8D6140EA18B57D3"> The table below shows cooling needs for a graphics workload. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_62BA1CEE9C8C4E79A48DB39BE979AB18"> Note that for sizing the heat exchanger on T_sensor limited systems, the lowest thermal resistance cooling need is the dominant recommended target. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_519EAA7B7E554A3EA60837B09EFD7209"> NVL SKUs could have cases where the GT-centric workload has more stringent cooling needs than the Reference IA MT workloads. 
		</li> 
	 </ul> 
