	 <p>Preliminary values and subject to change. 
	 </p> 
	 <p><sup>1</sup> NVL, Ψsn -hp , and Ψhp-a are calculated using Intel Technology Targets based on most up to date test data. 
	 </p> 
	 <p><sup>2</sup> Resistance are calculated based on the same thermal solution assumptions. 
	 </p> 
	 <p><sup>3</sup> The thermal solution used is 0.5mm cold plate soldered to 2 heat pipes (2nos. of original diameter of 6mm crushed to 1.4mm). 
	 </p> 
	 <p><sup>4</sup> The thermal solution used is 1.3mm cold plate soldered to 2 heat pipes (2nos. of original diameter of 6mm crushed to 1.4mm, 1no. of original diameter of 8mm crushed to 1.6mm). 
	 </p> 
	 <p><sup>5</sup> The GT workload has been changed from Vulkan Wildlife Extreme unlimited to 3D Mark Timespy based guidance. 
	 </p> 
	 <p><sup>6</sup> Refer for 14C 4Xe, the cooling needs of NVL 16C 4Xe as it has the same GPU cores. 
	 </p> 
